  "prefLabel": "Rev 902.04 New Hampshire Resident Or Inhabitant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 902.04 New Hampshire Resident Or Inhabitant. Any individual claiming to be an inhabitant or resident of New Hampshire to any state agency or political subdivision of New Hampshire, shall be deemed an inhabitant or resident of New Hampshire for purposes of taxation of income unless the individual can prove, by a preponderance of evidence, that he or she is an actual resident of another jurisdiction.\n\nSource. #4557, eff 12-28-88; ss by #5947, eff 12-29-94; ss by #6321, eff 8-22-96; ss by #8137, eff 8-10-04; ss by #10211, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13443, eff 8-12-22",
